It is evening.
I am back in my flat.
The sky is clear and blue.
It is not raining anymore.
I stand at the window.
The window is open.
Outside it is still cold.
But it is still bright.
The sun is slowly setting.
The light is golden.
I look at the roofs of Berlin.
Everything is very quiet.
I pick up my phone.
I open my weather app.
The forecast for tomorrow is very good.
Tomorrow it will be sunny.
It will not rain.
Tomorrow is Saturday.
I will ride my bicycle.
I am looking forward to the weekend.
